            <div class="legal-section">
                <h2 id="your-rights">7. Your Rights</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of your data</li>
                    <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Update inaccurate information</li>
                    <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request removal of your data</li>
                    <li><strong>Opt-out:</strong> Disable specific features to reduce data collection</li>
                </ul>
                <p>You can exercise these rights yourself with the bot's <code>/privacy</code> command, in any server or in a DM with the bot:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><code>/privacy export</code> &mdash; a JSON file of the data the bot holds about you, sent by DM (once a day). Moderation and safety records are listed as counts only.</li>
                    <li><code>/privacy delete</code> &mdash; deletes your cached messages, activity and statistics, levels, economy, game progress, preferences and linked accounts in every server (asks you to confirm; cannot be undone). Moderation and safety records, copies of messages a server logged as deleted, tickets and forms you sent to a server, and payment records are kept.</li>
                    <li>For Greenhouse Tycoon, <code>/privacy export</code> and <code>/privacy delete</code> cover the save linked to your Discord account, including the Twitch and Kick sign-ins linked to it.</li>
                    <li>On the Greenhouse Tycoon website, open <strong>Profile</strong> and use the <strong>Your data</strong> card. It works whether you sign in with Discord, Twitch or Kick, so you do not need Discord. <strong>Download my data</strong> saves a JSON file of your save and every sign-in linked to it (up to three times an hour). <strong>Delete my save</strong> deletes the same and signs you out on every device; you type DELETE to confirm, and it cannot be undone. Hybrids you bred first stay in the game&rsquo;s shared list of varieties without your name.</li>
                    <li>For the stream bot, <code>/privacy export</code> includes your stream bot profile and everything under it (without tokens, hashes or keys) and, as a viewer, events, song requests and likes about you in other streamers&rsquo; channels, found through the Twitch and Kick accounts you linked to CertiFried. <code>/privacy delete</code> deletes your stream bot profile and everything under it, including uploaded sound files; as a viewer it deletes those events and likes, removes your name and what you typed from song requests (the streamer keeps a nameless line), and removes your name and ID from other people&rsquo;s events and song requests that name you. Viewers without a CertiFried account can do the same on <a href="/privacy/viewer">Your viewer data</a>: sign in there with Twitch (no permissions asked) or Kick (<code>user:read</code> only) to download or delete the stream bot data held about that account in every streamer&rsquo;s channel.</li>
                    <li>To disconnect a device, choose <strong>Revoke</strong> on the stream bot&rsquo;s <a href="/stream/bot/devices">Devices</a> page (it is deleted 30 days later), or <strong>Remove</strong> to disconnect and delete it at once. To withdraw the Twitch grant, disconnect CertiFried in Twitch&rsquo;s Connections settings.</li>
                    <li><code>/privacy opt-out</code> / <code>/privacy opt-in</code> &mdash; stop or resume message logging (the bot keeps no copies of your messages) and appearing on leaderboards.</li>
                    <li><code>/privacy status</code> &mdash; see your current choices.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>Voice transcription and the chat reader have their own switch: <code>/voice privacy opt-out</code>. For anything the commands do not cover, including correcting inaccurate information, contact us through our Discord support server or at <a href="mailto:support@certifriedmultitool.com">support@certifriedmultitool.com</a>.</p>
                <h3 id="uk-eu-rights">If you are in the United Kingdom or the European Union</h3>
                <p>Under the UK GDPR and the EU GDPR you have the right to access your personal data, to have it corrected (rectification), to have it erased, to receive it in a portable format (portability), and to object to how we use it, as well as to restrict its use and to withdraw consent where we rely on consent. To use them:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Access and portability: <code>/privacy export</code> (a JSON file), the Greenhouse Tycoon <strong>Your data</strong> card, or <a href="/privacy/viewer">Your viewer data</a> for stream bot viewers.</li>
                    <li>Erasure: <code>/privacy delete</code>, the same Greenhouse card, or <a href="/privacy/viewer">Your viewer data</a>.</li>
                    <li>Objection and restriction: <code>/privacy opt-out</code> and <code>/voice privacy opt-out</code>, or ask us.</li>
                    <li>Rectification, or anything else: email <a href="mailto:support@certifriedmultitool.com">support@certifriedmultitool.com</a>. We answer within one month.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>You can also complain to your data protection authority (in the UK, the Information Commissioner&rsquo;s Office), though we would like the chance to sort it out first.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section">
                <h2 id="children-s-privacy">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
                <p>CertiFried MultiTool is not intended for users under age 13. Discord requires users to be at least 13 years old (older in some countries). Twitch and Kick also require users to be at least 13, or older where local law says so (Twitch: 16 in Australia; Kick: the local age of digital consent), and let users under 18 (or the age of majority) use them only with a parent&rsquo;s or guardian&rsquo;s supervision and agreement. (Checked on November 19, 2026 against Twitch&rsquo;s Terms of Service last modified August 12, 2026 and Kick&rsquo;s Terms of Service modified March 23, 2026.) If you use the stream bot or CertiFried Studio, you must meet the minimum age of each platform you connect. If we become aware that we have collected data from a child under 13, we will delete it promptly.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section">
                <h2 id="changes-to-this-policy">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
                <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify users of significant changes through the dashboard or Discord. Your continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>
            </div>

